    "summary": "Added an optional generated FFLAS-FFPACK backend for dense GF(p), p < 256, with direct multiplication, rank, and canonical RREF; measured automatic crossovers; exact FLINT fallback; isolated-native and dynamic-adapter execution; production and standalone-executable integration; deterministic declarations; differential, transactional, performance, and architecture tests; and the compiler/runtime fixes required by the generated C++ boundary.",
